<h4>RISC Summer 2008</h4>
ACA 2008 is a part of the <a href="http://www.risc.uni-linz.ac.at/conferences/summer2008">RISC Summer 2008</a> event that
consists of conferences and schools organized by RISC in summer 2008.
<p/>

